<title>USA: U.S. Feb factory orders rose 0.8 pct.</title>
<headline>U.S. Feb factory orders rose 0.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce seasonally adjusted data on U.S. factory orders, shipments and unfilled orders.</p>
<p>    ORDERS-PCT CHANGES:  Feb--(Prev)	Jan--(Prev)     Dec</p>
<p> New Orders		  0.8		  2.5    2.5     -1.5</p>
<p> -Ex-Transportation	1.6		  2.6    2.5     -1.6</p>
<p> -Ex-Defense		 0.9		  3.1    3.1     -1.3</p>
<p> NonDurables		 0.1		  0.9    0.7     -1.2</p>
<p> Durables		    1.5    1.5	 3.8    4.1     -1.7</p>
<p> NonDefense Cap	    3.5    3.7	 4.4    4.5	UNCH</p>
<p> -Ex-Aircraft, Parts     6.9    6.9	 3.1    3.2     -2.2</p>
<p> -Defense Cap	     -2.6    0.1     -23.0  -21.6     -8.1</p>
<p>    ORDERS-PCT CHANGES:  Feb--(Prev)	Jan--(Prev)     Dec</p>
<p> Durables NonDefense     1.6    1.5	 5.2    5.4     -1.4</p>
