<p> SHIPMENTS-PCT CHANGES:  Feb--(Prev)	Jan--(Prev)     Dec</p>
<p>  Total			0.9		  1.0    1.1     -0.7</p>
<p>  Durables		   1.6    1.4	 0.9    1.1     -0.8</p>
<p> ORDERS-BLNS OF DLRS:   Feb---(Prev)     Jan---(Prev)     Dec</p>
<p>  New Orders	    325.91	     323.21  323.20   315.42</p>
