<p>  NonDurables	   147.99	     147.84  147.53   146.53</p>
<p>  Durables		177.93  178.32   175.37  175.77   168.89</p>
<p>  NonDef. Cap	    47.44   47.55    45.82   45.85    43.87</p>
<p>  -Ex-Aircraft,Parts   40.48   40.52    37.87   37.91    36.74</p>
<p>  Defense Cap	     6.04    6.32     6.20    6.32     8.06</p>
<p>  DurablesNonDefense  171.88  172.00   169.17  169.45   160.83</p>
<p>  Unfilled-Total	523.56	     519.11  518.91   514.40</p>
