<p>  Durables		173.08  172.97   170.31  170.56   168.72</p>
<p> ORDERS-PCT CHANGES:     Feb--(Prev)	Jan--(Prev)     Dec</p>
<p>  Primary Metals	  -0.4   -0.5	 5.1    5.1	4.4</p>
<p>  Industrial Machinery   1.9    2.2	 0.9    0.9	2.1</p>
<p>  Electrical Equipment   7.1    7.4	17.8   17.9    -13.8</p>
