<p>  Transport Equip.     40.55   40.83    42.28   42.35    41.67</p>
<p>Wall Street economists had expected a 0.9 percent rise in total factory orders for February.</p>
<p>The February inventories-to-shipments ratio was 1.37, down from a revised 1.38 in January, previously reported at 1.37.</p>
<p>The department reported initial data on February orders for durable goods on March 26.</p>
